# Pre-commit review

When writing a component or committing, follow `.cursor/skills/pre-commit-review/SKILL.md`.

The git hook `.githooks/pre-commit` runs that review **locally** (Claude Code or Cursor CLI). It does not run in GitHub Actions. Do not add a CI job that needs a cloud AI token.

Check YAGNI, SOLID, KISS, DRY, **accessibilité numérique (WCAG 2.2 AA)** and **HTML sémantique**. Every public option of a staged component must appear in Storybook (story + MDX canvas). If the docs only show a bare Button, propose missing options such as Button + icon, icon-only, loading, sizes.
